{"self_link": "https://api.launchpad.net/devel/bugs/2167691", "web_link": "https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2167691", "resource_type_link": "https://api.launchpad.net/devel/#bug", "id": 2167691, "private": false, "information_type": "Public", "name": null, "title": "[FFe] upki integration into curl, by default", "description": "As upki finished MIR process now, we'd like to enable it by default. Given how late we are in the process, we should limit the enablement to `curl` to limit scope.\n\nThe proposed changes are follows:\n\n- curl Build-Depends on libupki-openssl-dev, producing libcurl4t64 (or maybe `curl`) Depends libupki-openssl1\n\n- `libupki-openssl1` is changed to `Recommends: upki` such that the service that fetches CRLite revocation data is included by default.\n\nThis will change particularly cloud-minimal and server-minimal seeds, and lots of desktops, pulling in two more packages:\n\n- upki weighs in at 3MB\n- libupki-openssl1 weighs in at 652 kB", "owner_link": "https://api.launchpad.net/devel/~juliank", "bug_tasks_collection_link": "https://api.launchpad.net/devel/bugs/2167691/bug_tasks", "duplicate_of_link": null, "date_created": "2026-09-18T10:34:46.904472+00:00", "activity_collection_link": "https://api.launchpad.net/devel/bugs/2167691/activity", "subscriptions_collection_link": "https://api.launchpad.net/devel/bugs/2167691/subscriptions", "date_last_updated": "2026-09-20T08:27:50.393592+00:00", "who_made_private_link": null, "date_made_private": null, "heat": 6, "bug_watches_collection_link": "https://api.launchpad.net/devel/bugs/2167691/bug_watches", "cves_collection_link": "https://api.launchpad.net/devel/bugs/2167691/cves", "vulnerabilities_collection_link": "https://api.launchpad.net/devel/bugs/2167691/vulnerabilities", "duplicates_collection_link": "https://api.launchpad.net/devel/bugs/2167691/duplicates", "attachments_collection_link": "https://api.launchpad.net/devel/bugs/2167691/attachments", "security_related": false, "latest_patch_upload